# Local-only operator logs. These accumulate raw ops detail — addresses,
# balances, incident notes, env-var names — and have historically carried
# secret FRAGMENTS (an Alchemy key prefix and a superseded Privy secret were
# scrubbed from records.txt on 2026-07-28). They are working notes, not
# product, and must never reach a public repo. Untracked deliberately: keep
# them on disk, never commit them.
records.txt
learnings.txt
script.txt
